aee80f117d03d233bcb38304317a128b75021246f42a437b9349410e9d179632","b3653f5f7af1de7c24ad167f4a82c877e0418bcbc5f8072727a4350ca9a8b226","b85cfa964ed474795563491595bb69cf4e97b9ebd726e13c5272e9aa9d520cac","ba67cd22dd9e00d87ba7298a112836e4684e3e6a1d22d88224663db16d0e15a7","bd8bcd7f22acd06c112b02d6c4a0e124ebd359fd6b2ed2dbecfeb65087888486","bedb278ead1567588b5e5bdc7d31c0bd85e3e273ee27d17d1dfba84194a89618","c0771e334fdf4a397ff711c09a469c067b2abc234eadeec3eadb9ee58e1ee83e","c13aded393e1814a0a4e66a8c8f1a53b4855193c7d2037ff48c147a4573eb438","c2a699cc66e5de200508ee86c9c0f03a91a2d2ba22741dc63d78003de5c13307","ca36d10a3471b67b0bfdeb5715783bc4ccfa41689797d9159032216c80293b6c","cda4fd3ec0130e8b3b7ea4a608c7996ce4dd03bd97129aad55e24a2551475ebe","d7a436785bf95cc3fb83235391682f951261e5e872c19ebe4bd3cea30e608c82","da7ff396849e1ba5e3535adbf57ecadc1811ba552856f623a787af9e1d1bc805","ed389b005de0e4d7eb56892f96f4f4f375ec7ade013e4aea6c59f0d031cde809","f233213d399caee6eecf90a0ee342a9d45c27dabbf4caffe61697641eadcca9a","f34f5c2a879a76a189d92d510a4011175c2db956464e292296abc0efc47fbd54","f6d34b9f13229efe67eec18aca6b56af81e643fa82ae02f42df264d28987323a","fbfdcf2ff788f4d903b97ab7589cc8189db46e0b60492447fd75376adbef86a0"],"sourceSha256":"60c9a0cb45019e7ead155216565046a6a231d4190f35d80ac7cfeae365c96681"},"2026.1.10:P05-Q07":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>氧化还原导致酸度改变</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.1.10 · 人大附中2026届高三上十月质量检测 · 原题7 · P05-Q07</div><h1>氧化还原导致酸度改变</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应基本概念</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：比较各反应氢离子变化。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/溶液的酸碱性与pH</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/离子反应/离子反应及离子方程式/离子方程式的书写</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H-1 C-12  O-16  F-19  Mg-24  Si-28  Mn-55  Cu-64</p><p>7. 下列物质混合后，因发生氧化还原反应使溶液pH增大的是</p><p>A. 向酸性KMnO<sub>4</sub>溶液中加入FeSO<sub>4</sub>溶液，紫色褪去</p><p>B. 向NaHSO<sub>3</sub>溶液中加入Ba(OH)<sub>2</sub>溶液，产生白色沉淀</p><p>C. 向BaCl<sub>2</sub>溶液中先通入SO<sub>2</sub>，后通入O<sub>2</sub>，产生白色沉淀</p><p>D. 向饱和NaCl溶液中先通入NH<sub>3</sub>，后通入CO<sub>2</sub>，产生白色沉淀</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】A</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．向酸性KMnO<sub>4</sub>溶液中加入FeSO<sub>4</sub>溶液，紫色褪去，说明发生氧化还原反应，离子方程式：<img src=\"chem-asset:971e98d6c085508c2b7fc0f0a2ba9a0a353d2c49b1d9dc6d2ee714689a0a5b1f:0;\" style=\"width:291.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，pH增大，故A正确；</p><p>B．向NaHSO<sub>3</sub>溶液中加入Ba(OH)<sub>2</sub>溶液，产生白色沉淀，发生复分解反应，不属于氧化还原反应，故B错误；</p><p>C．向BaCl<sub>2</sub>溶液中先通入SO<sub>2</sub>，后通入O<sub>2</sub>，产生白色沉淀，反应过程中H<sup>+</sup>增多，pH减小，故C错误；</p><p>D．向饱和NaCl溶液中先通入NH<sub>3</sub>，后通入CO<sub>2</sub>，产生白色沉淀，无元素化合价变化，不属于氧化还原反应，故D错误；</p><p>答案选A。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.1.10\\精品解析：北京市人民大学附属中学2025-2026学年高三上学期十月质量检测化学练习\\精品解析：北京市人民大学附属中学2025-2026学年高三上学期十月质量检测化学练习 （解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.1.10/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%B8%82%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%84%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%B8%82%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%84%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%20%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["971e98d6c085508c2b7fc0f0a2ba9a0a353d2c49b1d9dc6d2ee714689a0a5b1f"],"sourceSha256":"86d25f256a4f014754be5a6040a3296fac4826ab51355e7eefc0c5a0cafab95a"}}